      "content": "it's not that simple though. i've tried talking and i've tried making it up to them, but it just makes it worse. every time i try to fix things i just end up causing more tension. it feels like the more i'm around, the more i'm just draining the life out of them. it's like i'm a poison. i just want them to be happy again, and i know for a fact they wouldn't be if i was still a part of this.",
